[EVIDENCE] measured 2026-09-17: the blade offered 10 (es-ES pl-PL pt-PT ja-JP zh-CN de-DE it-IT en-US fr-FR ru-RU) while store @td(STORE_PRIMARY.id) configured 15 — sv-SE, no-NO, en-GB, el-GR and fi-FI were absent from the blade. Suspected defect: the blade reads a different language source than the store configuration {OBSERVED}

