[FORM] the toolbar 'Save' button is ENABLED while the reward points value is negative {OBSERVED}
[FORM] after save and reopen the reward points input still reads -5.00 — the negative value is persisted {OBSERVED}
[EVIDENCE] this pins CURRENT behaviour, not intended behaviour: VirtoOZ documents negative rejection (red highlight + disabled Save) for the Product factors Factor column ONLY, and no equivalent guard exists on an Order loyalty reward value. Suspected product defect — the case exists so that a future fix is detected as a CHANGE {OBSERVED}

